flowchart TD
 A[Buyer creates trade] --> B[Supplier accepts]
 B --> C[Buyer funds exact SDD]
 C --> D[Supplier commits required documents]
 D --> E[Buyer assigns inspector]
 E --> F[Inspector submits final attestation]
 F -->|Pass| G[Buyer has 72h to confirm]
 G -->|Confirm| L[ReleaseAuthorized]
 G -->|No confirmation by 72h| K[Either party may dispute]
 F -->|Fail| H[Buyer chooses]
 H -->|Refund| J[RefundAuthorized]
 H -->|Dispute| K
 K --> M[Resolver decision or mutual replacement]
 M -->|Release| L
 M -->|Refund| J
 L --> N[Async payout]
 J --> O[Async refund]
 N -->|success| P[Completed]
 O -->|success| Q[Refunded]
 N -->|failure| L
 O -->|failure| J
